{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 149,
    "dDurationMs": 2671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, we’re trying something that’s never\nbeen done before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2820,
    "dDurationMs": 5410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have made this video and Destin has made\na video on Smarter Every Day and we want you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8230,
    "dDurationMs": 2289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to play them both at the same time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10519,
    "dDurationMs": 4141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there’s a link to his video down in the\ndescription so find a way to load both of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14660,
    "dDurationMs": 15359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these videos and then synchronize them on\nmy mark in 5 4 3 2 1"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30019,
    "dDurationMs": 2861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Sydney, Australia we are at 34 degrees\nSouth Lattitude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32880,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is the opposite side of the world from\nHuntsville, Alabama."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36240,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, which way do the toilets flush?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38520,
    "dDurationMs": 17360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55880,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Simpsons did a whole episode based on\ntoilets flushing the opposite direction in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60050,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Australia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61050,
    "dDurationMs": 17130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus, other shows have supposedly demonstrated\nthis effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78180,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So is this a real effect or not?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80110,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“The application of this principle to water\ndraining in Earth's two hemispheres is just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85150,
    "dDurationMs": 4810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bunk.”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89960,
    "dDurationMs": 9430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you try it yourself, you’ll find inconsistent\nresults."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99390,
    "dDurationMs": 10570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This sink sometimes drains one way and sometimes\nthe other way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109960,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In any container of water there's always going\nto be some rotation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112990,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The water is not perfectly still."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115360,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is this, rather than the hemisphere\nthat determines which way the water will swirl"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119250,
    "dDurationMs": 9840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down the drain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129090,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what if we could eliminate all motion\nfrom the water?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134670,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have here a five foot wide kiddy pool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137050,
    "dDurationMs": 14510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I actually filled the pool in the anticlockwise\ndirection to be sure any clockwise motion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151560,
    "dDurationMs": 5079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we see is not due to how I filled the pool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156639,
    "dDurationMs": 5171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I’ve left this water sitting here for 24\nhours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161810,
    "dDurationMs": 3269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it seems like I've damped all of the motion\nfrom the filling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165079,
    "dDurationMs": 11030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I \nreally hope this works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176109,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin, wish me luck!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179989,
    "dDurationMs": 7181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm about to pull the plug 3... 2... 1..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187170,
    "dDurationMs": 11909,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the pool is draining, but you can't see\nany motion of the water just yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199079,
    "dDurationMs": 3601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To help us see where the water is flowing\nI'm going to put some food colouring in on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202680,
    "dDurationMs": 18169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the four cardinal directions around the pool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220849,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can clearly see that the water is flowing\nclockwise, in this direction and that makes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225319,
    "dDurationMs": 9640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sense because that's how it should flow in\nthe southern hemisphere due to the Earth's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234959,
    "dDurationMs": 6581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rotation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241540,
    "dDurationMs": 4039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you can see what a tiny little effect\nit is and what extraordinary lengths I had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245579,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to go to to see this effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248139,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So really you're not going to see it in a\nbathtub or in a toilet or in a sink because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252489,
    "dDurationMs": 6571,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are other sources of angular momentum\nthat totally wash out this effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259060,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Coriolis effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260440,
    "dDurationMs": 2879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There you have it..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263319,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It works!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264759,
    "dDurationMs": 6821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To understand how it works, imagine a pool\nwith one edge touching the south pole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271580,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The pool is stationary relative to Earth,\nbut every day it’s actually completing one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275560,
    "dDurationMs": 5810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "full revolution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281370,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see the side of the pool furthest\nfrom the pole travels much farther every day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285190,
    "dDurationMs": 10050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the side right next to the pole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295240,
    "dDurationMs": 4371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the outer side of the pool is moving fastest\ntowards the East and as you get closer to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299611,
    "dDurationMs": 6789,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the pole the velocity decreases down to zero."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306400,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now imagine we drain the pool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312960,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Water from the far side is moving too fast\nrelative to the drain and so it gets out ahead,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318560,
    "dDurationMs": 13370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whereas water from near the pole is going\ntoo slow and so it lags behind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331930,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when the water approaches the drain, it\nswirls clockwise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337110,
    "dDurationMs": 14209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the reason cyclones swirl clockwise\nin the Southern hemisphere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351319,
    "dDurationMs": 4511,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The higher pressure air rushes into the eye\nof the storm and, just like in our pool, swirls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355830,
    "dDurationMs": 8220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the direction dictated by the hemisphere\nAnd that’s the truth about toilet swirl"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364050,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I definitely learned something and if you\ndid too then you should share these videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367330,
    "dDurationMs": 5230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with your friends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372560,
    "dDurationMs": 3659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you should subscribe to this guy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376219,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Subscribe to Destin, Smarter Every Day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378539,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379629,
    "dDurationMs": 3281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, you're here!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382910,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what we're gonna do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388370,
    "dDurationMs": 8820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are going to subscribe to Veritasium en\nmass because it's an awesome channel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397190,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, oh look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400190,
    "dDurationMs": 1070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where is the subscribe button?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401260,
    "dDurationMs": 4969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But seriously, have you subscribed to Smarter\nEvery Day yet?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406229,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin has made some of the best videos on\nthe internet, like the backwards bicycle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411349,
    "dDurationMs": 3731,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Prince Rupert's Drop, and what it looks like\nto get a tattoo in slow motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415080,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've been friends with Destin for about three\nyears and I'm pretty much convinced that the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418960,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "man is superhuman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420580,
    "dDurationMs": 5329,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only does he run a remarkably successful\nYouTube channel, he also has a wife and four"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425909,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kids AND he has a full time job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428849,
    "dDurationMs": 2991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The man is literally a rocket scientist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431840,
    "dDurationMs": 5389,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he's friends with astronauts and when\nhe asks them questions, they answer him from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437229,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438229,
    "dDurationMs": 2131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"you are getting smarter every day\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440360,
    "dDurationMs": 2059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This man deserves your subscription."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442419,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're not subscribed to him already I\ndon't know what you've been doing with your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445380,
    "dDurationMs": 4759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "life, but go over to his channel right now\nand subscribe to Smarter Every Day and trust"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450139,
    "dDurationMs": 2451,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "me, you will thank me later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452590,
    "dDurationMs": 1879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I want to thank you for watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454469,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Y'know we have been working on this collaboration\nfor about three years and it feels so good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459439,
    "dDurationMs": 1901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to have it finally out there in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461340,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope you enjoyed it as much as we enjoyed\nmaking it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464470,
    "dDurationMs": 5729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, I'll see you next time."
    } ]
  } ]
}
